  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## **Build the High Rated Filter**\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Use your Sketch Lab plan to write a function called `filterHighRatedMovies`.\r\n\r\n   **OR**\r\n\r\n   Give your Sketch Lab plan to AI and ask it to write the function for you.\r\n\r\n2. Your function should:\r\n\r\n   * reset `displayMovies` to an empty array\r\n   * use `.map()` to go through each movie in `movies`\r\n   * use an `if` statement to check if the movie’s rating is **greater than a certain number**\r\n   * use `.push()` to add matching movies to `displayMovies`\r\n   * call `renderMovies()` at the end\r\n\r\n3. Use your function as the event handler for the **High Rated** button.\r\n\r\n4. Test your filter:\r\n\r\n   * Do only high rated movies appear?\r\n   * Is any low rated movie showing?\r\n",
